WEBVTT

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.740
The cream and sponge cake is really fluffy.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.800
The strawberries, kiwi, and pineapple 
are encased in something so fluffy.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.780
I'm sure they feel great in there.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:25.830
Fluffy!

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.420
Fluffy...

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.690
That feels good.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:37.340
The sweet fragrance and the 
fluffiness makes me feel great.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.930
<i>We can't see you, Your Highness.</i>

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.000
A futon made out of a roll cake...

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.810
That would be wonderful.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.620
<i>Her Highness always looks like
she's having a good time.</i>

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.520
Anyway, I'm going to get going.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.310
I'll be back soon.

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:28.170
Okay, see you later.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.060
All right, let's hurry and 
get these documents done.

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.670
Huh? We have all morning to do this.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:39.010
I want to get this done before 
Mullin gets back and surprise him.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.760
You're already done?! Wow!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.420
<i>She's cute to watch.</i>

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:53.620
<i>Business as usual in Her Highness 
Beelzebub's office yet again.</i>

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:59.700
<b>They Pass Each Other by Sometimes.</b>

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.050
<i>Two hours later.</i>

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.470
Mullin isn't back yet...

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:09.320
How about I get some tea?

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:11.960
I'm back.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.790
That took a while!

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:15.560
Sorry about that.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.590
I got caught up in the library.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.800
How were things for you?

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.460
Wait! You haven't gotten anything done!

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.970
You didn't come back, so I took a break.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.460
Are you serious?

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:31.480
Actually, I'm all—

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.080
You know, if you keep doing stuff like this,

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.960
I'm going to put in a transfer 
request to the library.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.810
Huh? What?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.600
Dantalion-san, just a second ago,

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.990
was asking me to work for him.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.690
Thanks for all of this.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.370
I know you came to get some documents,

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.490
but you're really helping me out.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:53.330
If Senpai would just do one hundred-millionth 
more work than he was doing now...

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.250
Hold on, butterfly!

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.970
<i>Though, I don't think you should be talking 
if you're going to sleep that much.</i>

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.240
<i>Not that I could tell him that.</i>

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:09.080
So, if you're going to slack off here,

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.680
then I'm going to go to the library instead.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:14.080
I-I see...

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.370
Y-Your Highness?

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.430
<i>Much more upset than he expected.</i>

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:21.700
Huh?

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:25.110
You're actually done with your work.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.360
Mullin-sama, that's what we were...

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:27.940
Huh?

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.400
I-It's time for lunch.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:35.670
I'll be back.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.920
Hey, Your Highness!

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:39.630
Oh, dear.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.970
Oh, dear.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:42.890
Huh? What?

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.300
Is this my fault?!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.930
I wonder if Mullin hates me.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.300
<i>She goes to Gocchin when she's in trouble.</i>

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.920
I'm sure you're thinking too much.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:01.930
He was just making a little joke.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:07.870
I know that, but it just kind of hit me.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.550
Then I'm going to go to the library instead.

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.390
That might have been what 
Mullin's really thinking—

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.720
something that just kind of slipped out.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:18.420
It's fine, believe me.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.890
She's honestly putting 
too much thought into this.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.750
If Mullin wants to work somewhere else,

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.890
then I don't really have the 
right to stop him, either.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:28.840
<i>Way too much.</i>

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.570
Maybe I should transfer with him!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:33.140
You can't do that.

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:38.650
Even if Mullin-kun was serious,

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.630
couldn't you just use your 
authority to stop him?

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:45.040
You're at the top of Pandemonium 
right now, anyway.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:48.300
That would be an abuse of my power. 
It'd make me a dictator.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.970
I don't want to do something like that.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.120
I don't want him to hate me.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.530
Bell...

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.330
<i>She's such a good person.</i>

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.020
It's okay...

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.660
You haven't really done anything to 
make him hate you, right?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:03.540
I don't think so.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.170
Wait, you did something?!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.880
It was a little bit ago, but...

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.920
I went to Mullin's house when 
he was sick to check on him...

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:12.600
What?

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:17.780
I'm not sure why I did it, either, but...

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.000
Mullin was asleep, so...

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.030
I...

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:24.160
I...

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:28.110
<i>D-Did you ki... ki...</i>

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.320
I checked to see if he had 
a fever with my forehead.

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.620
I-I see...

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:38.090
<i>Not sure whether that's being bold or something else.</i>

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:41.140
Am I weird?

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.980
Well...

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:49.800
If it was me, I couldn't just go to 
Azazel-sama's house like that.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:07:00.760
Bell, I'd be pretty sad if I lost 
Caim-san as my assistant, too.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.180
Gocchin...

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:04.360
<i>She doesn't know what to do for her.</i>

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.780
Have a macaron.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.530
<i>And meanwhile...</i>

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.840
Huh? You pissed Bell off?

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.940
Yes, well...

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.950
Well, that was dumb of you.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.740
Pretty stupid.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.750
You don't understand women at all.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.170
Yep.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:26.290
<i>What's up with these two?</i>

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.210
But think back to what your mom would do!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.800
You're not going to listen to your mom?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.260
Then I'm going to be someone else's mom instead!

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.970
No!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.000
You know, and then sometimes she'd say,

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.060
"You were found under a 
bridge, and I adopted you."

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.310
You're not Bell's mom, though.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:48.030
In any event, you should 
get back on her good side.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.090
How would I do that?

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.450
First, you need to apologize.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.140
Getting a present would be good, too.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.030
Yeah.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.760
A present? But I couldn't...

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.720
It could just be flowers, or something.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.840
I would be putting on so much of an 
act, I don't think I could do that...

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:03.460
You think so?

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.920
Plus, it's kind of like I'd be bribing her,

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.540
trying to use things to win her over.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.160
So moral.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:13.080
It's not about the present—it's 
about your feelings.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:16.080
You pick something out while 
thinking about that person.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.060
The time you spend and the feelings you 
have for that person are the real present.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:23.100
<i>I can't tell if he's just some sort of hot guy
or if he has the heart of a young girl.</i>

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.260
<i>It's both.</i>

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:28.620
Actually, do flowers even make girls happy?

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.360
You're the girl here. Tell us what you think.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:33.450
Flowers are good.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.230
Huh?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.710
They're nice and they brighten up a room.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.490
Oh, yeah.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.410
I gave you a bouquet the other day, didn't I?

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.630
Pink gerberas to say sorry 
for slacking off so much.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.660
And you get to throw them 
right away when they dry out.

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:53.580
This is pretty difficult.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.060
I'm going to get going.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.150
Thank you.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.550
I'm going to the bathroom, myself.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.260
Oh, pink gerberas.

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:15.980
That rejected budget for 
curtains from the other day...

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:18.120
Do you think you could 
take another look at that?

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:20.900
<i>She didn't get rid of them, after all.</i>

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.870
<i>I don't know what to do.</i>

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.140
<i>I should just talk to her...</i>

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.640
Your Highness, I...

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:41.710
It's fine.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.780
You can go wherever you want.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.820
You're sure taking this really hard.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.770
I was just joking.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:54.810
I wouldn't care if I didn't 
get to see you anymore.

00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:56.990
I'm fine.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:02.080
I would never put in a transfer request.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:05.830
Even if I did end up somewhere else, 
we could still meet up.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:06.970
Huh?

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:07.580
What?

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:17.030
Sorry, it's pretty weird 
to say we should meet up

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:19.220
when we don't even have 
work to do together...

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.870
It's not weird at all!

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:30.880
I'm sorry for being such a pain.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:31.620
No...

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:34.320
I'm sorry, myself.

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:45.100
<i>They didn't even know they 
were having a lovers' quarrel.</i>

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.630
Azazel-sama!

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.060
I like you...

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:01.060
I like you!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:08.560
I've always liked you...

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.890
It was a dream.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:22.820
<b>I Had a Dream.</b>

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.540
Oh, Belphegor.

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.720
I've come to make a return.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.770
Do you need any new books?

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.500
I'll pick something out myself.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.920
<i>I had such an embarrassing dream.</i>

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.050
<i>It was embarrassing enough that 
I had such a dream, but...</i>

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.260
<i>Having to pee just remembering it.</i>

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:51.590
<i>I hate the fact I had to check to see 
if I wet the sheets when I woke up.</i>

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.960
<b>*She didn't</b>

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.540
<i>What's going on with me 
having to pee all the time?!</i>

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:01.530
<i>I can tell him how I feel in my dream, but...</i>

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:06.130
<i>I wonder what type of 
books Azazel-sama reads.</i>

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.990
<i>I want to read something he's reading.</i>

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:14.500
Long, long ago, there was a
big bear and a little bear...

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:14.500
<i>It'd be nice to read a book with him.</i>

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.840
Please don't take the 
books into the bathroom.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.860
<i>She regained her composure.</i>

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.010
<i>This book looks interesting.</i>

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:30.710
<i>A princess is trapped in a tower 
after being kidnapped by a dragon.</i>

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:33.130
<i>A prince then comes and saves her.</i>

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.270
<i>How wonderful.</i>

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:39.190
<i>And then the two of them 
have a passionate embrace...</i>

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:45.090
<i>What would I do if Azazel-sama 
came to save me?!</i>

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:48.160
<i>I'd be so nervous, 
I don't think I could handle it!</i>

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:50.120
Princess, please open up!

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:52.740
Princess!

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:53.340
<i>I can't...</i>

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.210
<i>They'd never meet!</i>

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:01.300
<i>Even if I could tell him how I feel, 
there'd be no point with me like this.</i>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.180
<i>I couldn't be with him.</i>

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:07.460
<i>What's this?</i>

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.180
<i>I read this when I was young.</i>

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.650
<i>A prince turns into a frog,</i>

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:21.810
<i>and he can only turn back to normal 
when the princess kisses him.</i>

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:26.020
Turn back to normal...

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:26.560
Ribbit, ribbit.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:29.210
<i>I'd be too nervous if he 
turned back to normal!</i>

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:30.330
<i>I'm doomed!</i>

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:35.000
I don't think I'd be nervous
if he was a frog.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.990
Wait, so if he was a frog forever, 
I could be with him?!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.000
<b>Semi-Demonic
thought</b>

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:40.510
<i>I wonder if I'll be able to properly 
tell him I like him someday.</i>

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.420
<i>I can't even speak to him right now.</i>

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.070
<i>I like you.</i>

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.700
<i>I like you.</i>

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:53.830
<i>I love you.</i>

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:58.940
<i>I wish I could talk to Azazel-sama...</i>

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:03.790
<i>I wish he'd fall in love with me.</i>

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.950
You want this one?

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.040
Belphegor, are you hurt!?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.420
Did you hit yourself anywhere? 
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.010
Sorry, you fell because I surprised you.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.430
<i>No...</i>

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.980
<i>I-I'm sorry.</i>

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:38.600
Which book were you trying to get?
All of these fell...

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.280
Azazel-sama...

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:43.680
Memorandum.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:56.200
The memorandum?!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:56.200
Some
Memorandum

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.470
<i>A memorandum: A written 
message by an individual.</i>

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:56.200
<i>Also, a document expressing one's
personal experiences or ideas.</i>

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:58.600
<i>I had a slip of the tongue!</i>

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.830
<i>I tried to say "I like him"...</i>

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.420
<b>Can't hold it
anymore!!!</b>

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.880
<i>This is terrible!</i>

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.780
<i>Why did I say that just now?!</i>

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:14.890
<i>But Azazel-sama thinks I was 
talking about that memorandum...</i>

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.550
<i>Now it's even weirder that I just ran away!</i>

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.940
<i>This is all because I had that dream!</i>

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:26.050
<i>Memorandum!</i>

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:28.900
Thank you, come again.

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.450
She didn't want to borrow this?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:38.530
<i>Actually, since Gocchin always 
runs away like that,</i>

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:41.220
<i>Azazel didn't really think too much of it.</i>

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.200
<i>After they made up,</i>

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:53.260
<i>Beelzebub and Mullin have 
returned normally to work,</i>

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:55.650
<i>but there were several troublesome 
things to take care of,</i>

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.300
<i>and they ended up staying up 
late several nights in a row.</i>

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:02.100
<i>I'm really getting tired...</i>

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.690
Mullin, about this document...

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.140
<i>He's asleep.</i>

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.980
<i>I'd feel bad if I woke him up.</i>

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:12.110
<i>But...</i>

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.330
Your Highness...

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:15.810
Your Highness.

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:18.200
You can't just show everything...

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:20.040
You can't.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.680
Wake up, Mullin!

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:23.200
<i>Wake up now!</i>

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:27.590
Bro and Sister

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.000
Oh, Azazel-sama.

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:38.430
Butterfly.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:47.520
Sacchan and Astaroth

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.520
Work's boring.

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:52.820
Sacchan, I think I've worked enough today.

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:55.880
I think I've done enough of the
hard-working-young-man thing.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:16:59.740
Sacchan?

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.080
Are you asleep?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:07.300
Sacchan, if you fall asleep in here...

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:08.360
I...

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.630
<b>Whee!</b>

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.630
I'm just gonna have to go have fun!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.630
<b>Gonna go have fun!</b>

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.330
<i>Same as always.</i>

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:23.680
Bro and Gocchin

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.440
<i>Belphegor...</i>

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:27.210
<i>I guess she's asleep.</i>

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:32.320
<i>The wind's starting to blow a bit.</i>

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.340
<i>She's going to get cold.</i>

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.600
<i>I need to wake her up.</i>

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.120
<i>But if I wake her up, I'm going to scare her.</i>

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.240
<i>All warm.</i>

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:55.340
Dantalion and another two

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.610
<i>Zzz...</i>

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.300
<b>He's asleep...</b>

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:01.480
Dantalion! Dantalion!

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:02.400
I'm bored!

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:03.820
Let's jump rope!

00:18:03.820 --> 00:18:04.920
You shouldn't sleep!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.340
Stop! Stop now!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.900
Shut up, senpai.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.270
Hey!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.730
Mullin-sama, we've looked 
over all the documents here.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.400
Thanks.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.440
Go ahead and head out.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.320
We'll finish the rest ourselves.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:21.760
But...

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.090
We're fine.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:25.450
You two head back and rest.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.820
Thank you.

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.610
We'll take you up on your offer, then.

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.280
See you later.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.740
Yeah.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:35.990
Good work.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:41.030
Your Highness, once we're 
done with this, we can go.

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:42.890
Your Highness?

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.130
<i>She's asleep...</i>

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.500
<i>That's rare.</i>

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.180
<i>She must be really tired.</i>

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.780
<i>She's really beautiful.</i>

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:59.720
<i>It might be the first time I've 
got to see her face this close up.</i>

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.880
<i>What am I getting so nervous about?!</i>

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:06.010
<i>I need to wake her up.</i>

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:09.330
<i>No, but I want to let her 
sleep a bit longer...</i>

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:17.760
<i>She didn't wake up...</i>

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.280
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:23.720
<i>It's late at night, and I'm alone with a sleeping girl!</i>

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.430
<i>No, it doesn't matter if we're 
alone together. We're working.</i>

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.990
<i>This doesn't mean anything.</i>

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.830
<i>Yeah, it's work.</i>

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.350
<i>I need to wake her up.</i>

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:39.600
<i>It wouldn't be bad if I watched her
for a little longer, would it?</i>

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:42.200
<i>Kind of like a reward for 
doing all of this overtime.</i>

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.270
<i>No, I can't think like that!</i>

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:46.150
<i>She's my superior. My superior.</i>

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:51.580
She's rather defenseless right now...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.500
Her hair's in her face...

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:19.710
<i>Your Highness...</i>

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.360
Mullin-sama, at least have some refreshments.

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:25.210
I'm sorry!

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:26.130
I'm sorry!

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:28.580
I-I'm not doing anything!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:29.330
Huh?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.560
I'll have it over there!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.140
In the room over there!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.740
But I want Her Highness 
to have some as well—

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:35.340
It's fine!

00:20:38.980 --> 00:20:41.750
<i>Th-That surprised me...</i>

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.470
<i>She woke up halfway through,</i>

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:48.660
<i>but it was so awkward, 
she couldn't open her eyes.</i>

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:28.010
It's gotten cold lately.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:30.230
Let's hurry up and get to your room.

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:35.190
It's nice and warm.

00:22:35.190 --> 00:22:37.620
Your room's all warm.

00:22:38.980 --> 00:22:41.520
You brought out your heated table already.

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:42.240
Yeah.

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:03.560
Here you go, Gocchin.

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.840
Yum.

00:23:08.840 --> 00:23:09.780
Here you go, Bell.

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:15.370
It's good.

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.650
Even if it's gotten cold out outside,

00:23:17.650 --> 00:23:19.760
we can't stop eating cold sweets.

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:20.860
I know.

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:23.370
Bell, one more bite.

00:23:24.030 --> 00:23:25.820
Sure. You, too, Gocchin.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:32.890
<i>Cold sweets you eat in a warm room are nice.</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Separated by One Can of Coffee.</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Your Scent on a Cold Day.</b>

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:37.660
Look forward to next time.
